          "id": 600117225,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "In the Qt version, if you open up the Protocols list, typing a character will take you to the first protocol beginning with that character, with subsequent typing of the same character taking you to the next protocol beginning with that character.\n\nTested with 3.4.6 on macOS, 3.4.6 on Windows, and a main-branch build on Linux (macOS, Windows, and UN*X-plus-{X11,Wayland} being the three platforms we support).",
