        "0bfa32ee6c1cbf406c7dd1a90d8bce253dbc6b19"
      ],
      "title": "Qt: KeyboardInputInterval - allow more relaxed typing for keyboardSearch",
      "message": "Qt: KeyboardInputInterval - allow more relaxed typing for keyboardSearch\n\nGtk popped up a search box when typing in the tree view.\nMost places in Qt, a Search: field was added to the dialog.\nLooks possible to buffer keystrokes and do a string search in Qt.\n\nDefault value is 400ms (even on Windows). Average typing speed of\n200 cpm = 300ms per character = too close to 400ms when searching\nthe protocol name in Preferences -> Protocols.\n",
      "author_name": "Chuck Craft",
      "author_email": "bubbasnmp@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2021-06-13T21:16:15.000-05:00",
      "committer_name": "AndersBroman",
      "committer_email": "a.broman58@gmail.com",
